        ": سَأَلْتُهُ عَنِ اَلْجَارِيَةِ يَتَمَتَّعُ مِنْهَا اَلرَّجُلُ قَالَ \"نَعَمْ إِلاَّ أَنْ تَكُونَ صَبِيَّةً تُخْدَعُ\" قُلْتُ أَصْلَحَكَ اَللَّهُ وَ كَمِ اَلْحَدُّ اَلَّذِي إِذَا بَلَغَتْهُ لَمْ تُخْدَعْ قَالَ \"اِبْنَةُ عَشْرِ سِنِينَ\"."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.4591 - Muhammad bin Yahya al-Khathami narrated from Muhammad bin Muslim:\nI asked Imam (as) about a bondwoman - can a man engage in Mutah (temporary marriage) with her?\nImam (as) replied: \"Yes, except if she is a young girl who can be deceived.\"\nI said: \"May Allah (swt) rectify your condition, what is the age limit at which she cannot be deceived?\"\nImam (as) said: \"Ten years old.\""
        ]
      }
